  "problem": "|  | $3$ | $5$ | $7$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $2$ | $1$ | $1$ | $0$ |\n| $4$ | $1$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| $6$ | $0$ | $1$ | $0$ |\n\nThe adjacency matrix of the relation $R,$ defined over the sets $\\{2,4,6\\}$ and $\\{3,5,7\\},$ is given above. Which of the following ordered pairs belong to the relation?\n\nI. $(2,7)$\n\nII. $(6,5)$\n\nIII. $(6,3)$",
